Secure optical semantic communication — selected research code release

This project incorporates source code from the supplied Promptus project,
whose LICENSE is Apache License 2.0. The original license is retained.
Promptus: Can Prompts Streaming Replace Video Streaming with Stable Diffusion
https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.20032

The research/sgm, research/scripts and research/configs directories are
upstream support code retained from that snapshot. Original per-file notices
remain in place. The small detection-head resources belong to the bundled
upstream inference pipeline; they are not SD-Turbo model checkpoints.

Modifications for this release: portable path defaults, a standalone physical
codec, validated MATLAB loading, optional PyTorch CPU/CUDA response recovery,
tests, examples, documentation, and a configurable evaluation leak-count list.
Source hashes and changes are recorded in docs/source_manifest.json.

The original experimental scripts are credited to the contributing project
authors. Third-party model weights are not redistributed, and their terms
are not replaced by the source-code license. Experimental measurements are
covered separately by DATA_LICENSE.md.

